1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,683
约 860 亿个神经元
Around 86 billion neurons

2
00:00:03,733 --> 00:00:07,417
体重的 2%，能耗的 20%
2% of body weight, 20% of its energy

3
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:11,150
人类大脑
The Human Brain

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,883
第一部分 · 脑区巡礼
PART 1 · A TOUR OF THE BRAIN REGIONS

5
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:22,350
额叶：大脑的“指挥中心”
Frontal lobe: the brain's command center

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:29,817
顶叶：身体与空间的地图
Parietal lobe: a map of body and space

7
00:00:29,867 --> 00:00:37,283
颞叶：听见、理解、记住
Temporal lobe: hearing, understanding, remembering

8
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:44,750
枕叶：视觉从这里开始
Occipital lobe: where vision begins

9
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:52,217
岛叶：倾听身体内部的声音
Insula: listening to the body from within

10
00:00:52,267 --> 00:00:59,683
海马：把经历写进记忆
Hippocampus: writing experience into memory

11
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:07,150
杏仁核：危险的第一警报
Amygdala: the first alarm for danger

12
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:14,617
基底神经节：选择动作，养成习惯
Basal ganglia: choosing actions, forming habits

13
00:01:14,667 --> 00:01:22,083
丘脑：感觉信息的总中转站
Thalamus: the grand relay station of the senses

14
00:01:22,133 --> 00:01:29,550
下丘脑：身体稳态的“恒温器”
Hypothalamus: the body's thermostat

15
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:37,017
小脑：精准运动的“校准器”
Cerebellum: the calibrator of precise movement

16
00:01:37,067 --> 00:01:44,483
脑干：生命中枢
Brainstem: the center of vital functions

17
00:01:44,533 --> 00:01:48,217
聚焦：前额叶皮层
Zoom in: the prefrontal cortex

18
00:01:48,267 --> 00:01:51,950
最晚成熟的脑区之一：发育持续到二十多岁
Among the last regions to mature, developing into the mid-20s

19
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:59,417
第二部分 · 前额叶七大亚区
PART 2 · SEVEN SUBREGIONS OF THE PFC

20
00:01:59,467 --> 00:02:06,883
DLPFC：大脑的“工作台”
DLPFC: the brain's workbench

21
00:02:06,933 --> 00:02:14,350
受损后：计划困难，思维僵化
When damaged: poor planning, rigid thinking

22
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:21,817
VLPFC：在冲动面前踩下刹车
VLPFC: hitting the brakes on impulse

23
00:02:21,867 --> 00:02:29,283
左侧受损：说不出想说的话
Left-side damage: unable to say what you mean

24
00:02:29,333 --> 00:02:36,750
额极：同时驾驭多个目标
Frontal pole: juggling multiple goals

25
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:44,217
思考你自己的思考
Thinking about your own thinking

26
00:02:44,267 --> 00:02:51,683
OFC：为每个选项标价
OFC: putting a price on every option

27
00:02:51,733 --> 00:02:59,150
规则变了，它帮你及时转向
When the rules change, it helps you adapt

28
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:06,617
vmPFC：把情绪变成决策信号
vmPFC: turning emotion into decision signals

29
00:03:06,667 --> 00:03:14,083
一根铁棍，改写了神经科学
One iron rod rewrote neuroscience

30
00:03:14,133 --> 00:03:21,550
ACC：冲突与错误的警报器
ACC: the alarm for conflict and errors

31
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:29,017
它也决定了疼痛有多“难受”
It also shapes how much pain hurts

32
00:03:29,067 --> 00:03:36,483
dmPFC：读懂他人的心
dmPFC: reading other minds

33
00:03:36,533 --> 00:03:43,950
社会认知的核心枢纽
A core hub of social cognition

34
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:47,683
中央执行网络：专注当下任务
Central executive network: focusing on the task

35
00:03:47,733 --> 00:03:51,417
默认模式网络：内省与想象
Default mode network: introspection and imagination

36
00:03:51,467 --> 00:03:55,150
突显网络：在两者之间切换
Salience network: switching between the two

37
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:58,883
前额叶从不单独工作
The prefrontal cortex never works alone

38
00:03:58,933 --> 00:04:02,617
思考 · 抑制 · 选择 · 共情
Think · Inhibit · Choose · Empathize

39
00:04:02,667 --> 00:04:06,350
认识大脑，就是认识自己
Know your brain, know yourself

40
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:13,817
感谢观看
Thanks for watching

